# Kaggle API Credentials for SolSight real PCBA dataset download
# 1. Log in to https://www.kaggle.com
# 2. Go to Account Settings -> "API" section -> Click "Create New Token"
# 3. Open the downloaded kaggle.json file and paste your credentials below:
KAGGLE_USERNAME=your_kaggle_username_here
KAGGLE_KEY=your_kaggle_api_key_here
